{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21192","headline":"西州院 · 元稹","name":"西州院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自入西州院，唯见东川城。\n今夜城头月，非暗又非明。\n文案牀席满，卷舒赃罪名。\n惨凄且烦勌，弃之阶下行。\n怅望天廻转，动摇万里情。\n参辰次第出，牛女颠倒倾。\n况此风中柳，枝条千万茎。\n到来篱下笋，亦已长短生。\n感怆正多绪，鵶鵶相唤惊。\n墙上杜鹃鸟，又作思归鸣。\n以彼撩乱思，吟爲幽怨声。\n吟罢终不寝，冬冬复铛铛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}